      "Living abroad for almost 20 years as a working professional and later/now as a busy student, proud father, and husband, I missed sharing memories with friends back home. I built this to bridge that gap and provide a space for deep self-reflection, including for those in need of better mindfulness tools that don't cost a lot of money. AI finally enables elegant script polishing, turning an old dream into reality. I feel social media is a dopamine void; this slows things down, attaching genuine feelings to photos to create cinematic reflections for yourself and those you care about."
    </blockquote>

